WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.600
[Electronic beat] The articulated ROB turns its head. The neck pans and the camera tilts.

00:00:05.600 --> 00:00:10.500
The cyan title changes to Shoulder Sweep. The two shoulder assemblies move in turn.

00:00:10.500 --> 00:00:16.000
The view moves toward the drive assembly. The flippers and six wheels animate.
